      "version": "1.1.0",
      "description": "<p>Icons are HERE!</p>\n<p>New features:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>ICONS - 3 visual setups: TextOnly, IconAndText, IconOnly</li>\n<li>70+ icons for buffs/debuffs and skills (u can change them if u want to on this folder BepInEx\\plugins\\MedEffectsHUD\\icons - there is some overridding icons in positive and negative buffs so watch them too. Size of icons needs to be 32x32 and PNG ONLY! DO NOT RENAME ICON NAMES!)</li>\n<li>Different icons on same buff depends on is it positive or negative. Can be changed manualy on icons folder</li>\n<li>IconOnly Grid — short and compact version of buffs - now u can see it more clearly. Configurable</li>\n<li>Notifications: at the start of negative buff or at the end of positive buff u will get an icon of that buff - just to make sure u will see “pain or bleed on you or painkiller is went off - Configurable</li>\n<li>Default game font “Bender”, or whatever installed on your PC. Configurable</li>\n<li>Change the HUD height. Auto or manualy (via config)</li>\n<li>Change icon size in bars or notifications.</li>\n</ul>\n",
